# Brickflow conventions

- Core workflow logic lives in `brickflow/engine/`
- CLI commands in `brickflow/cli/`
- Databricks bundle codegen in `brickflow/codegen/`
- Plugins in `brickflow_plugins/` — separate from core library
- Follow existing workflow/task/project patterns in examples/
- Do not change public CLI surface without explicit request
